# /srv/moa/env/admin.env (optional): the main portal's run-time settings
# (repo moa_web, apps/admin). Nothing is required today:
#   - MOA_API_URL is set by compose.yml (http://backend:8000);
#   - the Sentry DSN is written into the image when CI builds it
#     (moa_web: deploy/build/<environment>.env).
# Anything added here applies with: sudo /srv/moa/deploy.sh recreate admin
